---
// MedicalSwissTurningSection.astro
// Entity cluster: CNC Swiss Machining + Grade 23 Titanium (Ti-6Al-4V ELI) + Medical Bone Screws & Dental Abutments
// Technical depth: High L:D ratio, surface roughness Ra ≤ 0.4 µm, osseointegration optimization
---
<section class="relative py-24 overflow-hidden" style="background-color: var(--theme-bg);">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.02]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 1px 1px, var(--theme-primary) 1px, transparent 0); background-size: 40px 40px;"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center px-4 py-2 mb-4 text-sm font-semibold rounded-full border" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 10%, transparent); border-color: var(--theme-primary); color: var(--theme-primary);">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 12L3.269 3.126A59.768 59.768 0 0121.485 12 59.77 59.77 0 013.27 20.876L5.999 12zm0 0h7.5" /></svg>
        CNC Swiss Turning
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6" style="color: var(--theme-text);">
        <span style="color: var(--theme-primary);">CNC Swiss Machining</span> — Grade 23 Ti-6Al-4V ELI Medical Bone Screws &amp; Dental Abutments
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xl max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 65%, transparent);">
        High-precision CNC Swiss turning of Grade 23 Titanium (Ti-6Al-4V ELI — Extra Low Interstitials) for medical bone screws, dental abutments, and micro-implants. Surface roughness controlled to Ra ≤ 0.4 µm to promote optimum osseointegration.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden" style="background-color: var(--theme-surface); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">
        <div class="p-8">
          <div class="flex items-start mb-5">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mr-4" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 10%, transparent);">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 12L3.269 3.126A59.768 59.768 0 0121.485 12 59.77 59.77 0 013.27 20.876L5.999 12zm0 0h7.5" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold" style="color: var(--theme-text);">Grade 23 Ti-6Al-4V ELI Swiss Turning</h3>
              <span class="text-sm font-medium" style="color: var(--theme-primary);">CNC Swiss Lathe · Extra Low Interstitials · Bone Screws</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 60%, transparent);">
            Grade 23 Ti-6Al-4V ELI (ASTM F136) is the gold standard for surgical implants — with reduced oxygen, carbon, and iron content for improved fracture toughness and biocompatibility. Our CNC Swiss lathes produce bone screws, dental abutments, and micro-implants in diameters from 1.5–12 mm with L:D ratios exceeding 20:1, all in single-setup operations.
          </p>
          <div class="mx-0 h-px mb-6" style="background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 30%, transparent), transparent);"></div>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4 block" style="color: var(--theme-primary);">Technical Implementation</span>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-start text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 70%, transparent);"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 mr-2 shrink-0" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>Swiss guide bushing support for L:D ratios up to 20:1 on bone screw blanks — eliminates deflection in Grade 23 ELI titanium</li>
            <li class="flex items-start text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 70%, transparent);"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 mr-2 shrink-0" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>Single-setup turning, thread whirling, cross-drilling, and slotting — 1.5–12 mm diameter range</li>
            <li class="flex items-start text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 70%, transparent);"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 mr-2 shrink-0" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>Diametral tolerances held to ±0.005 mm — critical for interference-fit bone screw threads</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden" style="background-color: var(--theme-surface); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">
        <div class="p-8">
          <div class="flex items-start mb-5">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mr-4" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 10%, transparent);">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M11.48 3.499a.562.562 0 011.04 0l2.125 5.111a.563.563 0 00.475.345l5.518.442c.499.04.701.663.321.988l-4.204 3.602a.563.563 0 00-.182.557l1.285 5.385a.562.562 0 01-.84.61l-4.725-2.885a.563.563 0 00-.586 0L6.982 20.54a.562.562 0 01-.84-.61l1.285-5.386a.562.562 0 00-.182-.557l-4.204-3.602a.563.563 0 01.321-.988l5.518-.442a.563.563 0 00.475-.345L11.48 3.5z" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold" style="color: var(--theme-text);">Surface Roughness &amp; Osseointegration</h3>
              <span class="text-sm font-medium" style="color: var(--theme-primary);">Ra ≤ 0.4 µm · Bone Interface Optimization</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 60%, transparent);">
            Implant surface finish directly affects bone cell adhesion and osseointegration. Our Swiss turning achieves Ra ≤ 0.4 µm on thread flanks and bone-contact surfaces — produced through precision-ground form tools and micro-finishing passes that eliminate micro-cracks and stress risers on Grade 23 ELI titanium components.
          </p>
          <div class="mx-0 h-px mb-6" style="background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 30%, transparent), transparent);"></div>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4 block" style="color: var(--theme-primary);">Technical Implementation</span>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-start text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 70%, transparent);"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 mr-2 shrink-0" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>Precision-ground form tools produce Ra ≤ 0.4 µm on thread roots and flanks — promotes osteoblast cell attachment</li>
            <li class="flex items-start text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 70%, transparent);"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 mr-2 shrink-0" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>Controlled thread root radius eliminates micro-notches — reduces stress concentration under cyclic loading</li>
            <li class="flex items-start text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 70%, transparent);"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mt-0.5 mr-2 shrink-0" style="color: var(--theme-primary);" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd" /></svg>100% optical thread inspection — compliant with ASTM F543 bone screw standards</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 text-sm" style="color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-text) 50%, transparent);">
      <span class="font-semibold" style="color: var(--theme-primary);">Entity Cluster:</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 8%, transparent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">CNC Swiss Machining</span>
      <span class="text-xs">+</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 8%, transparent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">Grade 23 Ti-6Al-4V ELI</span>
      <span class="text-xs">+</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 8%, transparent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">Medical Bone Screws</span>
      <span class="text-xs">+</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 8%, transparent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">Dental Abutments</span>
      <span class="text-xs">+</span>
      <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono" style="background-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 8%, transparent); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-primary) 15%, transparent);">ASTM F136</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
